@RestAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5251
@token = 

### Логин (admin / admin)
POST {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Autorize/login?login=admin&password=admin

### Цеха
GET {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Workshops

### Работники цеха 1
GET {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Workers?workshopId=1

### Спецодежда
GET {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Workwears

### Получения работника 1
GET {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Receipts?workerId=1

### Создать получение (нужен Bearer token)
POST {{RestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workerId": 3,
  "workwearId": 1,
  "receivedAt": "2026-04-01",
  "signed": false
}
